<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- One part, two complete 4/4 bars, proving mid-score tempo markings are
     all tracked (Ref 12 "multi-tempo scope"), not just the first:
       M1  quarter=100 - C D E F
       M2  quarter=200 - G A B C5
     Every bar is rhythmically complete so pickup detection does not fire. -->
